Description: Hypermodules are cohesive groups of species emerging from
    congruent modules across two interconnected bipartite networks. This
    package implements the HyperMod algorithm to detect hypermodules and
    null models for comparisons. It also provides functions for plotting
    tripartite networks with highlighted hypermodules.
